WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:03.680
We've added the so called Superman Deterrent.

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:06.160
What we are seeing is a crime wave around the world.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.380
What did you this weekend Diana?
Me?
Mm.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:21.520
Nothing very interesting.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.540
No protectors here.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.260
No Lanterns.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.080
No Kryptonian.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:44.700
This world will fall.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.600
Like all the others.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.500
Gone is the days when one's biggest concerns

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.680
were exploding wind-up penguins.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:58.260
This is crazy.

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:01.400
Fighting the devil and his army... in hell.

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:05.620
Don't engage alone.

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:07.420
We do this together.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:11.680
Its really cool you guys seem ready to do battle and stuff

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:12.900
but I've never done battle

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:15.940
I just push some people and run away.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:20.000
Relax Alfred, I'll take it from here.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.080
Er, do i know you?

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.540
Superman is a beacon to the world.

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:32.320
He didn't just save people.

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:35.220
He made them see the best parts of themselves.

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:40.660
I don't recognize this world.

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:43.720
You don't have to recognize it.

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:46.920
woooohoooooo!!!

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:49.320
You just have to save it.

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:54.260
How many of you are there?

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:55.300
Not enough.

00:01:55.305 --> 00:01:56.575
Do you really think that.. ?

00:01:58.215 --> 00:02:01.335
Oh wow they just, they really just vanished...

00:02:01.345 --> 00:02:02.525
huh, oh..

00:02:02.945 --> 00:02:04.075
thats rude.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:16.200
He said you'd come.

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:18.340
Now lets..

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:19.100
hope...

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:20.480
you're not too late.

